        options: ["4 km/h", "2 km/h", "3 km/h", "1 km/h"],
        correct: 0,
        explanation: "Let speed of stream be s. Downstream speed = 8 + s. Upstream speed = 8 - s. Time = 24/(8+s) + 24/(8-s) = 8. Divide by 8: 3/(8+s) + 3/(8-s) = 1 => 3(8-s + 8+s) / (64-s²) = 1 => 3(16) = 64 - s² => 48 = 64 - s² => s² = 16 => s = 4. Option A is correct."
