        correct: 1,
        explanation: "Sum of ages of 30 students = 30 * 15 = 450. When teacher is included, total people = 31, average = 16. Sum of ages = 31 * 16 = 496. Teacher's age = 496 - 450 = 46 years. Option B is correct."
